# Order amendments (launch)

CS amends once in OMS → Shopify (+ Monday name/email) → CommunicationLog audit.

## Done now
- Contact (name, email, phone)
- Delivery address
- Delivery instructions (OMS + `containerdoor_ops.delivery_instructions`)
- Soft cancel line / entire order (`customerStatus=cancelled` + Shopify metafield)

## Audit
Every field change → CommunicationLog (`oldValue` / `newValue` / `sentBy` / time).
Hidden in Activity UI until `SHOW_FIELD_CHANGE_LOGS` is true.

## Not yet (next slice)
- Product variant swap via Shopify `orderEdit*`
- Hard Shopify `orderCancel` / Cin7 void
- Cin7 address push

API: `GET|POST /api/order-amendments`
UI: Detail → Customer → Amend
